    "version": "1.0.0",
    "blockDef": {
      "type": "cpp_print_formatted",
      "inputsInline": true,
      "previousStatement": "Statement",
      "nextStatement": "Statement",
      "colour": "#5CB1D6",
      "tooltip": "%{BKY_C_PRINTF_TOOLTIP}",
      "builder": "variadic",
      "labelKey": "C_PRINTF_FORMAT_LABEL",
      "labelFallback": "格式化輸出 (printf)",
      "headInputName": "FORMAT_ROW",
      "leadingField": {
        "type": "field_input",
        "name": "FORMAT",
        "text": "%d\\n"
      },
      "slotPrefix": ",",
      "slotCheck": "Expression",
      "minCount": 1
    },
    "codeTemplate": {
      "pattern": "printf(\"${FORMAT}\"${ARGS});",
      "imports": [
        "stdio.h"
      ],
      "order": 0
    },
    "astPattern": {
      "grammar": "tree-sitter-cpp",
      "nodeType": "call_expression",
      "constraints": [
        {
          "field": "function",
          "text": "printf"
        }
      ]
    },
    "renderMapping": {
      "fields": {
        "FORMAT": "format"
      },
      "inputs": {},
      "statementInputs": {},
      "dynamicRules": [
        {
          "countSource": "itemCount",
          "childSlot": "args",
          "inputPattern": "ARG_{i}"
        }
      ]
    },
    "_why": "🟢 **2026-08-26：改用宣告式的可變參數建構子**（`builder: \"variadic\"`）。\n🪦 在此之前這份宣告把參數**擠進一個文字欄位**（`ARGS: field_input`），而 `component.json` 說 `children: [\"args\"]`——**參數在語義上是子節點**。\n也就是說：這一刀不是「刪掉就降」，是**判哪一邊對**（`retire-imperative-block` 第 1 步）\n——命令式那份的可變插槽是對的，而宣告那份錯了。\n⚠️ 而每一格從「變數下拉／接點二選一」變成**單純的接點**，理由與 `cin >>` 同一條：\n左值接點化之後那個 select 模式只剩「少一層巢狀」，而它的代價是同族的積木投影不一致。\n🟢 缺的兩個機制當天補上：`headInputName`（`FORMAT_ROW`）與 `slotPrefix`（逗號）。"
  }
]
